/target/
/target-arm/
/.preloop/
/.aksh/
/.runner-watch/repos/
/.runner-watch/**/*.pid
/.runner-watch/conformance/
# Runtime state and raw protocol captures: regenerable artifacts. The
# captures can carry signed OAuth JWTs and internal addresses, so they must
# never be tracked (the redacted flows.jsonl goldens are committed by design).
/.runner-watch/state.json
/.runner-watch/goldens/
/.runner-watch/dap-captures/
# Conformance goldens: keep the replayable flows.jsonl fixtures in git so CI can
# run `runner-watch conform`, but drop the heavy raw captures and binary bodies.
/.runner-watch/golden/**/*.mitm
/.runner-watch/golden/**/*.bin
# Real-world repo campaign captures: GitHub's own run logs for third-party
# repos, fetched on demand (tens of MB). The findings live in
# docs/fidelity-gap.md; the raw logs are regenerable with `gh run view --log`.
/.runner-watch/goldens/
/.runner-watch/repos-conformance-*.md
*.db
*.sqlite
*.log
.DS_Store

experiments/mitm/.cache/
experiments/mitm/captures/
experiments/mitm/reports/
experiments/mitm/golden/
